\"bcv(9,20,5)\">1Sam 20:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,24)\">1Sam 20:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,3)\">1Kgs 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 23:24\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,24)\">Jer 23:24</ref>, so (figurative) <ref ref=\"Isa 28:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,15)\">Isa 28:15</ref> with <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,19)\">1Sam 20:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 34:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,22)\">Job 34:22</ref> absolute <ref ref=\"Jer 36:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,19)\">Jer 36:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 22:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,3)\">Prov 22:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 27:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,12)\">Prov 27:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 28:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,28)\">Prov 28:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:47\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,47)\">Ps 89:47</ref> with <bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Deut 7:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,20)\">Deut 7:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 13:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,20)\">Job 13:20</ref>, with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Ps 55:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,13)\">Ps 55:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be hid, concealed</highlight>, especially figurative of escaping God's notice, with <bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Gen 4:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,14)\">Gen 4:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>מִלִּפְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 16:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,16,17)\">Jer 16:17</ref>, <bdbheb>מִנֶּגֶד עֵינַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 9:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,3)\">Amos 9:3</ref>, <bdbheb>מֵעֵינַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,16)\">Isa 65:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 13:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,14)\">Hos 13:14</ref> (subject <bdbheb>נֹחַם</bdbheb>, i.e. I will not repent, change my purpose of judgment), <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 38:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,10)\">Ps 38:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 40:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,27)\">Isa 40:27</ref> from heat of sun <ref ref=\"Ps 19:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,7)\">Ps 19:7</ref> (i.e. it penetrates everywhere); from birds <ref ref=\"Job 28:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,21)\">Job 28:21</ref> (of place of wisdom); reciprocal <bdbheb>אִישׁ מֵרֵעֵהוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִסּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:49\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,49)\">Gen 31:49</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) when <highlight>we are hidden each from the other</highlight> (i.e. separated); absolute <ref ref=\"Num 5:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,13)\">Num 5:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 3:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,23)\">Job 3:23</ref> (<highlight>whose way is hid</highlight> that is, from himself), <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:3\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,3)\">Zeph 2:3</ref> (i.e. escape <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s judgment); participle <highlight>hidden, secret things</highlight>, in general <ref ref=\"Deut 29:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,28)\">Deut 29:28</ref> of sins <ref ref=\"Ps 19:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,13)\">Ps 19:13</ref>. <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> feminine singular <bdbheb>סַתְּרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 16:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,3)\">Isa 16:3</ref> <highlight>carefully hide</highlight> (i.e. <highlight>shelter</highlight>) the outcasts (Moab speaks to Zion). <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> feminine singular <bdbheb>אַהֲבָה מְסֻתָּ֑רֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 27:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,5)\">Prov 27:5</ref> <highlight>love carefully concealed</highlight>. <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תִּסְתַּתָּ֑ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 29:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,14)\">Isa 29:14</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מִסְתַּתֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,19)\">1Sam 23:19</ref> + 3 t.; — <highlight>hide oneself carefully</highlight>, of David's taking refuge with (<bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb>) Ziphites <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,19)\">1Sam 23:19</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 54:2\"