\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,22,11)\">2Chr 22:11</ref> 1 singular <bdbheb>וָאַסְתִּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,23)\">Ezek 39:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,24)\">Ezek 39:24</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>הַסְתֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,11)\">Ps 51:11</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַסְתֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,18)\">Deut 31:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 57:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,17)\">Isa 57:17</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַסְתֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 25:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,2)\">Prov 25:2</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>i. 213 and references</sup></lookup>; yet compare infinitive absolute <bdbheb>אָכֹל</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 25:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,27)\">Prov 25:27</ref>), <bdbheb>לַסְתִּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 29:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,15)\">Isa 29:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:53q»§ 53q</sup>); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַסְתִּיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,17)\">Isa 8:17</ref> — <highlight>conceal, hide:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a person from (<bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי</bdbheb>) enemy <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\